{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261116/photo/bkn-20261116111806831-1116_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261116114538\"/><p>涉事樓宇火勢猛烈。</p><p>泰國布吉府卡圖縣芭東商業區一幢4層高樓宇於當地凌晨起火，波及鄰近公寓，造成至少11人死亡，逾30人受傷。目前未知起火原因，有指死傷者都是當地人。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.300862+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:18:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T14:12:20.127337+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:36.734195+00:00","content_hash":"7de744bd34773ec28152e8f6a6465d27e36f2220874b98ebb3752ffec44aafac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T04:12:03.300862+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}